# Codex review 20260904T055230Z (P1): the surface listed implementation modules but OMITTED the
# contract package itself - so the real ring modules, whose only contract import IS
# glp/contract/ring_descriptor, consumed "zero listed modules" and were refused, while an
# unrelated subtree importing one internal parser module could be admitted as a realization.
# The contract package is the surface a realization is held to; it belongs here.
glp/contract/ring_descriptor
glp/contract/surface
